[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4555350886","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119814#issuecomment-4555350886","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119814","id":4555350886,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABD4UjZg","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-27T14:16:10Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T14:33:10Z","body":"Hello! May I ask if you could check if this issue is reproducible with SDL's `testcontroller` application, please? \n[testcontroller.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28311485/testcontroller.zip)\nBefore running `testcontroller` file there, you should run `export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$LD_LIBRARY_PATH:./`, so the system can find the SDL library file.\n\nI got the files from the official SDL repository's GitHub Actions ( https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/actions/runs/26483611060 )\nfrom the file called `SDL-ubuntu-latest`.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4555350886/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4558216903","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119814#issuecomment-4558216903","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119814","id":4558216903,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABD7Dexw","user":{"login":"notroid5","id":87585310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NTg1MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87585310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5","html_url":"https://github.com/notroid5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-27T20:02:58Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T14:55:42Z","body":"Tested all buttons in SDL, here are the relevant results:\n- Capture => shown as `Misc1`/`Button5`\n- Home => shown as `Guide`/`Button12`\n- Z => shown as `Left Trigger`/`Button 8`, also vibrates while holding (does not do this at all in Godot)\n- B => shown as `East`/`Button1`\n- A => shown as `South`/`Button 0`\n- C left => show as `West`/`Button 4`\n- C right => show as `Back`/`Button 2`\n- C up => show as `North`/`Button 10`\n- C down => show as `Right Trigger`/`Button 3`\n\nKeep in mind that I'm not familiar with SDL, so some differences may be expected. (Regarding Capture/Home)\nSDL recognises it as `Nintendo N64 Controller`.\nI hope that helps. :)\n\nI also saw that you wrote something about the Joy-Cons here but you probably deleted it.\nDid you mean to post that in #119817 instead?\nIf I can check something, do not hesitate to tell me.\n\nOn that note, kinda wondering why this issue is the only one with the `needs testing` label.\n#119785, #119786, #119817 are all about similar controller issues.\nThe first two also do not have the `platform:linuxbsd` label.\nTechnically, this one is also the least \"severe\" since every button is at least mapped to something.\n\nEdit: I guess the right stick would be the closest to what could be mapped as the C buttons? Not sure if that is the right choice, though.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4558216903/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4560802784","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119814#issuecomment-4560802784","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119814","id":4560802784,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABD9hT4A","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-28T04:20:29Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T04:22:17Z","body":"May I ask if you could print the GUIDs for ypur controllers? `print(Input.get_joy_guid(0))`","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4560802784/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4563961235","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119814#issuecomment-4563961235","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119814","id":4563961235,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEAiFkw","user":{"login":"notroid5","id":87585310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NTg1MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87585310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5","html_url":"https://github.com/notroid5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-28T12:27:01Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T12:51:15Z","body":"This one (N64) has the following GUID:\n`05001c5e7e0500001920000001800000`\n\nI'll edit it into the bug report in the other issues.\n\nEdit: Done","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4563961235/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4564213319","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119814#issuecomment-4564213319","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119814","id":4564213319,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEAxeRw","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-28T13:01:56Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T13:01:56Z","body":"Thanks!\n\nAlthough I just took a look at the controller itself and I'm not sure if we should really change the way the buttons get recognized, since the controller doesn't have Select, X, and Y buttons, so the C buttons are mapped as those instead.\nZR being mapped as the left stick press and C down being mapped as the right trigger feels strange to me though, maybe we can swap them.\n\nWhat do you think?\n\n<img width=\"585\" height=\"574\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/68964c93-81c4-4ad2-ba0e-77003b937d8b\" />","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4564213319/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4565262653","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119814#issuecomment-4565262653","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119814","id":4565262653,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEBxhPQ","user":{"login":"notroid5","id":87585310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NTg1MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87585310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5","html_url":"https://github.com/notroid5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-28T14:47:10Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T14:47:10Z","body":"Seems reasonable, the C Buttons can probably stay the way they are right now, except for C Down.\nAlthough I also suggest switching A and B, in addition to switching ZR and C down.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4565262653/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4565842349","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119814#issuecomment-4565842349","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119814","id":4565842349,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABECU5rQ","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-28T15:49:43Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T15:49:43Z","body":"The SDL creator said the current way the buttons get interpreted for this controller is the same way they work with HIDAPI joystick driver, which is what the controller actually sends, so the current mapping is intentional, and I'm not sure we should fix this issue. 😅 \nSee https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/pull/15710\n\nI feel like if we fix the issue in Godot (while it still stays in SDL) it might create more confusion, and we would have to fix the issue in [HIDAPI joystick driver for this controller](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/thirdparty/sdl/joystick/hidapi/SDL_hidapi_switch.c) ourselves as well.\n\nI will close the issue for now, since I'm not sure we should fix this issue.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4565842349/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4566920269","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119814#issuecomment-4566920269","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119814","id":4566920269,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEDWsTQ","user":{"login":"notroid5","id":87585310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NTg1MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87585310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5","html_url":"https://github.com/notroid5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-28T18:08:37Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T18:08:37Z","body":"Alright, at least every button is mapped uniquely, thank you for your efforts!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4566920269/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4567331000","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119814#issuecomment-4567331000","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119814","id":4567331000,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEDvwuA","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-28T19:03:18Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T19:03:18Z","body":"You're welcome! :)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4567331000/reactions","tot